b.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Looks like this PR is re-adding .uid files for some Resources that had them intentionally removed. This is questionable (although at least in case of translations I can agree).\n\nThere are some core changes that someone needs to review too. I noticed this PR also includes #110779, I guess that PR could be merged separately, if UIDs belong in ScriptServer. And #114944 too, but the code is a bit different? 🤔\n\nAs for editor changes... There is lots of them, so it's difficult to do a detailed review. I checked over all of the code and it seems fine, but also feels a bit over-engineered. Like, there are many new structs, enums, or fields in EditorFileSystem. It's difficult to test if this new code is more reliable, or if it introduces some edge-case bugs (like the error spam I discovered, which wasn't there before). It does look more robust at least.\nI did see some random errors in the current editor file system, especially when moving scripts, so I guess this could use some broader testing to see if it resolves these bugs, while not breaking anything.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113035#pullrequestreview-3903563639","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113035","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113035#pullrequestreview-3903563639"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113035"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-06T20:59:59Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3906437221,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7o14Bl","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?u=aba5a323c950ddd46e8027fb0ced27b96d4856a1&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"htt